{"id":"memorial_200902","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial200900","label":"OLD TALES · Corruption Report - Unofficial (1/2)"},"label":"Corruption Report II - Unofficial","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_200901","next":"memorial_200903","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_200902_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"Preparations are required. I must:"},{"id":"memorial_200902_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"Seize a Rapture that induces Corruption and prepare a batch of mass-produced Nikkes."},{"id":"memorial_200902_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"Convert the facility into a laboratory more conducive to conducting experiments."},{"id":"memorial_200902_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"Prepare sufficient sustenance to recharge the Rapture's core."},{"id":"memorial_200902_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"It weighs heavy on one's heart, but it must be considered a necessary sacrifice for a harmonious union in the future."},{"id":"memorial_200902_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_oldtales_02_02_description","text":"Someday, there will be those who understand that my intentions are noble."}]}